																		// 0:Unknown 1:Long sleeve 2:Short sleeve 3:Long coat 4:Jacket and jeans 5: T-shirt 
																		// 6:Sportswear 7:Down-filled coat 8:shirt 9:Dress 10:suit 11:sweater 12:Sleeveless 13:vest
